<title>SWITZERLAND: Winterthur positive profit trend continues.</title>
<headline>Winterthur positive profit trend continues.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The positive trend in the profits of the Winterthur Group continued into the first five months of 1997, company chairman Peter Spaelti said.</p>
<p>&quot;The first five months of the current year have seen a continuation of the positive profit trend,&quot; Spaelti said in the text of a speech to be given to the annual news conference.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
